15 14h3"></path></svg></span>账户与成本</h3><div class="v3-profile-research-chapter__body"><div class="v3-profile-account-block v3-venue-invitation-disclosure"><div class="v3-registration-notes__body"><h4 class="v3-profile-account-section__heading">邀请信息摘要</h4><p class="v3-profile-account-section__hint">查看邀请信息与账户条件。</p><div class="v3-venue-quick-registration"><div class="v3-venue-quick-registration__body"><span class="v3-venue-quick-registration__label">专属邀请码</span><button type="button" class="v3-venue-quick-registration__code" data-copied="false"><strong translate="no">nexu888</strong><span>复制</span></button><small class="v3-copy-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></small><small>按 Bitget 当前合作条件享用户手续费权益</small></div><a class="v3-venue-quick-registration__cta" href="/zh-hans/exchanges/bitget#registration-path" data-cta-kind="research" data-cta-platform="bitget" data-cta-placement="venue-hero-quick-registration" data-growth-decision="registration_card_review" data-growth-placement="venue-hero-quick-registration" data-registration-confirmation-entry="registration-card">核对邀请码与注册条件</a></div><div class="v3-venue-rebate-card"><div class="v3-venue-rebate-card__left"><span class="v3-rebate-tag">核对费率、储备金、KYC 与杠杆</span><h2 class="v3-rebate-title">按 Bitget 当前合作条件享用户手续费权益</h2><div class="v3-rebate-code-row"><span class="v3-rebate-code-label">合作邀请码<!-- -->:</span><button type="button" class="v3-rebate-code-btn"><strong translate="no">nexu888</strong><span class="v3-copy-tip">点击复制</span></button></div></div><div class="v3-venue-rebate-card__right" aria-label="邀请信息摘要"><div class="v3-rebate-route-summary"><span>下一步</span><strong>使用上方官方入口继续</strong></div></div></div><section class="v3-profile-account-section v3-profile-account-cost"><header><h4 class="v3-profile-account-section__heading">费率、条件与费用测算</h4><p class="v3-profile-account-section__hint">集中查看费率、储备金、KYC、杠杆与年度费用</p></header><div class="v3-profile-cost-conditions__body"><div class="v3-venue-metrics-grid"><div class="v3-metric-tile"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><path d="M4 20h16M6 16V9M12 16V4M18 16v-6"></path></svg></span><span class="v3-metric-tile__label">现货基准费率</span><strong class="v3-metric-tile__val text-blue" translate="no">0.10% / 0.10% (挂单 / 吃单) · 普通用户 · Bitget 标准现货基础范围</strong><span class="v3-metric-tile__sub">使用 Bitget 在 VIP 档位或 BGB 折扣之前的标准现货费率。BGB 抵扣、VIP 档位、活动、账户专属条款和地区资格，需在实时 Fee Schedule 与官方账户流程中核对。</span></div></div><div class="v3-detail-calculator"><div class="v3-detail-calc__head"><h4>在 Bitget 交易一年能省多少钱？</h4><span class="v3-detail-calc__current-vol" translate="no">预估月交易量: <strong>$<!-- -->50<!-- -->K / mo</strong></span></div><input type="range" min="1000" max="500000" step="5000" class="v3-detail-calc__slider" aria-label="月交易量滑块" value="50000"/><div class="v3-detail-calc__result"><span>费率或用户权益尚未完成来源核验，最终条件以平台官方账户显示为准</span></div></div><section class="v2-section v3-fee-matrix-section" id="fee-schedule"><div class="v3-fee-matrix-card" data-venue-fee-model="sourced-base-fees"><div class="v3-fee-matrix-head"><div><h2 class="v3-fee-matrix-title">Bitget<!-- --> · <!-- -->交易费用</h2><p class="v3-fee-matrix-sub">通过官方费率页比较现货与合约的挂单、吃单费用。VIP 档位、优惠和最终费率取决于平台及账户条件。</p></div></div><div class="v3-fee-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="交易费用"><table class="v3-fee-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">交易费用</th><th scope="col">挂单</th><th scope="col">吃单</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-fee-product="spot"><th scope="row">普通用户<span class="v3-fee-scope-label">Bitget 标准现货基础范围</span></th><td>0.10%</td><td>0.10%</td></tr><tr data-fee-product="futures"><th scope="row">普通用户<span class="v3-fee-scope-label">官方费率页的基础费率</span></th><td>0.02%</td><td>0.06%</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="v3-fee-scope-note" data-fee-scope="public-standard-spot-base-account-region-not-proven-bgb-discount-excluded"><p>使用 Bitget 在 VIP 档位或 BGB 折扣之前的标准现货费率。BGB 抵扣、VIP 档位、活动、账户专属条款和地区资格，需在实时 Fee Schedule 与官方账户流程中核对。</p><p><span style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">查看费率来源<span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span> · <!-- -->核实日期<!-- -->: <time dateTime="2026-10-10">2026-10-10</time></p></div><div class="v3-fee-scope-note" data-fee-scope="official-fee-page-base-account-region-not-proven"><p>取自核实日期当天的平台官方费率页。VIP 档位、平台币折扣、活动、账户专属条款和地区资格均不包含在内，需在官方账户流程中确认。</p><p><span style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">查看费率来源<span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span> · <!-- -->核实日期<!-- -->: <time dateTime="2026-10-10">2026-10-10</time></p></div></div><div class="v3-fee-matrix-footer"><div class="v3-fee-cta-inline"></div><div class="v3-fee-cta-inline"><span class="v3-fee-tip">合作邀请码<!-- -->: <strong translate="no">nexu888</strong></span><a href="/go/bitget?src=fee-summary&amp;locale=zh-Hans" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer" class="v3-fee-lock-btn" data-cta-kind="registration" data-cta-platform="bitget" data-cta-placement="fee-summary" data-growth-decision="bitget" data-growth-placement="fee-summary">打开邀请注册链接<!-- --> ↗</a></div></div></div></section></div></section><section class="v2-section v3-detail-grid v3-profile-decision" id="registration-checklist"><section class="v3-profile-account-section v3-profile-account-decision"><header><h4 class="v3-profile-account-section__heading">展开完整注册前决策说明</h4><p class="v3-profile-account-section__hint">适配人群、限制和 KYC / 入金检查集中在这里</p></header><div class="v3-registration-notes__body"><article class="venue-decision"><h3>适合谁</h3><small class="venue-decision__context">来源复核状态</small><p lang="zh-Hans">公开产品、地区资格与官方费率待逐项核对</p></article><article class="venue-decision"><h3>为什么选</h3><p lang="zh-Hans">仅展示有来源和复核日期的事实</p></article><article class="venue-decision"><h3>不适合谁</h3><p lang="zh-Hans">地区限制、账户资格与活动条件待官方核验</p></article><article><span>注册 / KYC / 入金前核对</span><ul class="v3-detail-list vx-check-tiles"><li><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="14" rx="3"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="11" r="2"></circle><path d="M6 16c0-3 6-3 6 0M15 10h3M15 14h3"></path></svg></span><span>当前地区是否可开户</span></li><li><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="14" rx="3"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="11" r="2"></circle><path d="M6 16c0-3 6-3 6 0M15 10h3M15 14h3"></path></svg></span><span>KYC 等级、限额与法币通道</span></li><li><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="14" rx="3"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="11" r="2"></circle><path d="M6 16c0-3 6-3 6 0M15 10h3M15 14h3"></path></svg></span><span>所需现货或衍生品是否真实可用</span></li><li><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="14" rx="3"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="11" r="2"></circle><path d="M6 16c0-3 6-3 6 0M15 10h3M15 14h3"></path></svg></span><span>活动条款、时效与资格限制</span></li></ul></article></div></section></section></div></div></div></section><section class="v3-profile-research-chapter" data-research-task="sources"><h3 class="v3-profile-sources-group__heading"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 4-4 7-8 9-4-2-8-5-8-9V6Z"></path><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"></path></svg></span>来源与安全</h3><div class="v3-profile-research-chapter__body"><div class="v3-profile-evidence-block"><div class="v3-profile-evidence-block__body"><section class="v2-section v3-por-section" id="proof-of-reserves"><div class="v3-por-card"><div class="v3-por-header"><div class="v3-por-badge-row"><span class="v3-por-shield-badge"> <!-- -->资产偿付能力审计</span></div><h2 class="v3-por-title">Bitget 资产储备证明 (PoR) 深度透视与链上核验</h2><p class="v3-por-desc">Bitget 的储备金、审计与偿付能力信息应以最新官方披露和可复核来源为准；本页不把未核验数字写成保证。</p></div><div class="v3-por-verify-guide"><h4 class="v3-por-guide-title">交易者三步链上自查指南</h4><div class="v3-por-steps"><div class="v3-por-step"><span class="v3-por-step-num">01</span><div><strong>获取专属 Merkle 节点哈希</strong><p>登录官方个人中心「资产储备证明」页面，导出您账户当期的专属密码学叶子节点 Hash。</p></div></div><div class="v3-por-step"><span class="v3-por-step-num">02</span><div><strong>运行开源密码学校验脚本</strong><p>在本地或通过官方开源脚本，将个人节点沿 Merkle Tree 向上哈希计算，比对是否包含在公开的根哈希 (Merkle Root) 中。</p></div></div><div class="v3-por-step"><span class="v3-por-step-num">03</span><div><strong>比对链上冷钱包总地址余额</strong><p>在 Nansen、DefiLlama 或区块链浏览器中核对平台公布的冷钱包总额是否大于等于负债总和。</p></div></div></div></div><div class="v3-por-footer"><div class="v3-por-cold-warning"><span class="v3-warning-icon"></span><div><strong>自存私钥安全准则</strong><p>交易所储备金证明仅反映历史审计截面的偿付能力。大额闲置数字资产请务必转移至 Ledger、Trezor 等硬件冷钱包自持私钥，彻底规避平台黑天鹅风险。</p></div></div><span class="v3-por-audit-btn" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">查验官方储备金审计报告<span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></div></div></section><section class="v2-section v3-security-section" id="anti-phishing"><div class="v3-security-card"><div class="v3-security-header"><div class="v3-security-badge-row"><span class="v3-security-tag"> <!-- -->官方域名来源记录与反钓鱼核对</span><span class="v3-verified-badge">NexuAlpha 来源记录已核对</span></div><h2 class="v3-security-title">Bitget 防钓鱼官方域名与社群全景白名单</h2><p class="v3-security-sub">加密货币领域常有黑客购买 Google 搜索关键词广告投放高仿钓鱼网站。请认准以下已记录主域名与备用域名，切勿通过不可信搜索广告链接登录。</p></div><div class="v3-domains-grid"><div class="v3-domain-box primary"><div class="v3-domain-box__header"><span class="v3-domain-type">已记录主域名</span><span class="v3-ssl-indicator">● <!-- -->来源记录一致</span></div><div class="v3-domain-box__content"><code translate="no">www.bitget.com</code><button type="button" class="v3-copy-domain-btn">复制域名地址</button></div><small class="v3-copy-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></small><small>该域名来自已审阅记录，打开后仍需核对平台页面提示</small></div><div class="v3-domain-box mirrors"><div class="v3-domain-box__header"><span class="v3-domain-type">已记录备用域名</span><span class="v3-status-dot">● <!-- -->来源记录</span></div><div class="v3-mirrors-list"><div class="v3-mirror-item"><span class="v3-mirror-lock"></span><code translate="no">bitget.com</code><span class="v3-mirror-badge">来源记录</span></div><div class="v3-mirror-item"><span class="v3-mirror-lock"></span><code translate="no">www.bitget.com</code><span class="v3-mirror-badge">来源记录</span></div></div></div></div><div class="v3-security-tools-bar"><div class="v3-tool-left"><span class="v3-tool-icon"></span><div><strong>官方渠道真伪验证器</strong><p>收到自称官方客服的 Telegram 私聊、邮件或网址？请使用官方验证工具一键核验对方身份真伪。</p></div></div><span class="v3-open-verifier-btn" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">前往官方渠道真伪验证器<span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></div><div class="v3-rules-row"><div class="v3-rule-card"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 4-4 7-8 9-4-2-8-5-8-9V6Z"></path><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"></path></svg></span><span class="v3-rule-badge">防骗规则 1</span><strong>绝不点击 Google 搜索首条赞助广告</strong><p>黑客常伪造仿冒顶级域名并在搜索广告中买量，请直接输入官方域名或通过书签访问。</p></div><div class="v3-rule-card"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 4-4 7-8 9-4-2-8-5-8-9V6Z"></path><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"></path></svg></span><span class="v3-rule-badge">防骗规则 2</span><strong>官方人员绝不会在 Telegram 主动私聊</strong><p>任何在 Telegram/Discord 私聊要求输入助记词、充值解冻或私下 OTC 的 100% 为诈骗分子。</p></div><div class="v3-rule-card"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 4-4 7-8 9-4-2-8-5-8-9V6Z"></path><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"></path></svg></span><span class="v3-rule-badge">防骗规则 3</span><strong>必须开启账户安全防钓鱼码</strong><p>在个人安全中心设置防钓鱼码 (Anti-Phishing Code)，官方发送的每一封邮件都会印有您的专属安全暗号。</p></div></div></div></section><section class="v2-section research-panel" id="platform-facts"><div class="research-heading"><div><p>看事实与差异，不看虚构评分</p><h2>平台具体有什么</h2></div><small>资料核对<!-- --> <time dateTime="2026-09-04T19:59:35Z">2026-09-04</time></small></div><dl class="research-facts" lang="zh-Hans" dir="ltr"><div><dt>现货费用模型</dt><dd>Bitget 现货费用文章把 maker 定义为增加流动性的订单，把 taker 定义为移除流动性的订单。<span lang="zh-Hans" aria-label="查看来源: 现货费用模型" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">查看来源<!-- --> <span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></dd></div><div><dt>合约费用组成</dt><dd>Bitget 合约费用指南区分交易手续费和资金费，并把订单价值定义为数量乘以价格。<span lang="zh-Hans" aria-label="查看来源: 合约费用组成" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">查看来源<!-- --> <span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></dd></div><div><dt>身份验证流程</dt><dd>身份验证指南从账户资料入口开始，随后要求选择居住/签发地区和证件类型。<span lang="zh-Hans" aria-label="查看来源: 身份验证流程" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">查看来源<!-- --> <span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></dd></div><div><dt>官方动态入口</dt><dd>Bitget 公告中心按最新消息、上新、产品更新、竞赛、下架、安全、机构服务、API 交易、法币和维护/系统更新分类。<span lang="zh-Hans" aria-label="查看来源: 官方动态入口" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">查看来源<!-- --> <span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></dd></div></dl><details class="research-references"><summary>官方参考资料<!-- --> <span>4</span></summary><ul><li><span style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">Bitget spot trading fees, limits, and rules<span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></li><li><span style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">Bitget futures fees guide<span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></li><li><span style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">Bitget identity verification guide<span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></li><li><span style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com">Bitget announcement center<span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></li></ul></details></section><section class="v2-section official-research-teaser" id="reward-research"><h2>奖励与活动研究</h2><div class="official-research__states"><span class="official-research__state" data-period="UNKNOWN">需登录账户确认</span><span class="official-research__state" data-period="UNKNOWN">期限未确认</span><strong class="official-research__recheck">需要重新核对</strong></div><div class="official-research__body" lang="zh-Hans" dir="ltr"><p>欢迎礼包汇总了不同任务，还包含邀请他人的任务，并非单纯充值即得现金。</p></div><div class="official-research__actions"><a href="/zh-hans/activities/research/bitget">查看条款与来源</a><span>来源核对<!-- -->: <time dateTime="2026-09-06T18:11:47Z">2026-09-06</time></span></div></section></div></div></div></section><section class="v3-profile-research-chapter" data-research-task="follow-up"><h3 class="v3-profile-sources-group__heading"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-line