on><details class="venue-section-disclosure"><summary>常见问题</summary><div class="venue-section-disclosure__body"><section class="v2-section v3-faq-section" id="faq"><div class="nx-rule nx-rule--section" aria-hidden="true"><span class="nx-rule__label nx-rule__index"></span><span class="nx-rule__line"></span><span class="nx-rule__stamp">5</span></div><div class="v3-faq-card"><div class="v3-faq-card__header"><h2 class="v3-faq-card__title">Bitget 费用与使用条件问答</h2><p class="v3-faq-card__lead">按具体问题查看答案及对应官方来源。</p></div><div class="v3-faq-list"><details class="v3-faq-item"><summary class="v3-faq-summary"><div class="v3-faq-summary-left"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 .5c0 2-2.5 2-2.5 4M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><span class="v3-faq-q-text">Bitget 当前记录的官方域名是什么？</span></div><span class="v3-faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="v3-faq-content"><p>Bitget 当前记录的官方域名为 www.bitget.com。</p></div></details><details class="v3-faq-item"><summary class="v3-faq-summary"><div class="v3-faq-summary-left"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 .5c0 2-2.5 2-2.5 4M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><span class="v3-faq-q-text">Bitget 交易所账户和 Bitget Wallet 有什么区别？</span></div><span class="v3-faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="v3-faq-content"><p>Bitget Wallet 官方开发者文档说明，它是一款非托管加密钱包。Bitget 交易所账户是另一套注册：用邮箱或手机号注册，注册表单中可选填邀请码，完成身份认证后才能充值、提现和交易。本页显示的邀请码用于交易所账户注册。</p><p class="v3-venue-direct-answer__links"><span data-cta-kind="source" data-cta-placement="venue-faq-source" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="web3.bitget.com"><span>Bitget Wallet — Docs (About Bitget Wallet)</span><span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->web3.bitget.com</span></span><span data-cta-kind="source" data-cta-placement="venue-faq-source" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com"><span>Bitget — How to register an account</span><span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span><span data-cta-kind="source" data-cta-placement="venue-faq-source" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com"><span>Bitget — How to complete KYC</span><span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></p></div></details><details class="v3-faq-item" hidden=""><summary class="v3-faq-summary"><div class="v3-faq-summary-left"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 .5c0 2-2.5 2-2.5 4M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><span class="v3-faq-q-text">Bitget 邀请码在哪里填写？</span></div><span class="v3-faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="v3-faq-content"><p>网页表单填写邮箱或手机号后，在点击 Next 前填写可选邀请码。</p><p class="v3-venue-direct-answer__links"><span data-cta-kind="source" data-cta-placement="venue-faq-source" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com"><span>bitget — 来源</span><span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></p></div></details><details class="v3-faq-item" hidden=""><summary class="v3-faq-summary"><div class="v3-faq-summary-left"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 .5c0 2-2.5 2-2.5 4M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><span class="v3-faq-q-text">Bitget 邀请码注册后还能补填吗？</span></div><span class="v3-faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="v3-faq-content"><p>官方帮助没有确认注册后可以补填邀请码；不要假设可以事后添加。</p><p class="v3-venue-direct-answer__links"><span data-cta-kind="source" data-cta-placement="venue-faq-source" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="bitget.com"><span>bitget — 来源</span><span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->bitget.com</span></span></p></div></details><details class="v3-faq-item" hidden=""><summary class="v3-faq-summary"><div class="v3-faq-summary-left"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 .5c0 2-2.5 2-2.5 4M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><span class="v3-faq-q-text">Bitget 返佣什么时候到账？</span></div><span class="v3-faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="v3-faq-content"><p>合作伙伴数据称 Bitget 按每日支付；仍需满足资格条件。</p><p class="v3-venue-direct-answer__links"><a href="/intel/partners.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-kind="source" data-cta-placement="venue-faq-source"><span>NexuAlpha — 来源</span> ↗</a></p></div></details><button type="button" class="v3-faq-list__expand" aria-expanded="false">查看其余 3 个问题<span aria-hidden="true"> ↓</span></button></div></div></section></div></details><details class="venue-section-disclosure"><summary>热门币种</summary><div class="venue-section-disclosure__body"><section class="v2-section v3-venue-coins" aria-labelledby="coins-bitget"><div class="section-lead"><h2 id="coins-bitget">Bitget 上的热门币种</h2></div><ul class="v3-venue-coins__list"><li><a href="/zh-hans/coins/bitcoin"><b>Bitcoin</b><span translate="no">BTC</span></a></li><li><a href="/zh-hans/coins/ethereum"><b>Ethereum</b><span translate="no">ETH</span></a></li><li><a href="/zh-hans/coins/bnb"><b>BNB</b><span translate="no">BNB</spa