nt account controls, but their operational boundaries are not identical. Bybit's passkey guide says Passkey 2.","zh-Hans":"本文只处理可由当前官方或机构来源支撑的决策问题。它不预测价格，不承诺收益，不声称任何平台、API、钱包、稳定币轨道、托管路线、代币化资产或政策框架天然安全，也不把本地草稿、历史队列、旧截图、搜索摘要或 AI 摘要当成当前事实。"},"relatedVenues":[],"researchClaims":["c1","Bybit describes Passkey 2.0 as a FIDO passkey using biometrics registered on the user device for secure verification.","bybit-passkey","medium","c2","Bybit says removing a passkey can result in a 24-hour withdrawal restriction for account and asset security.","c3","Bybit withdrawal guidance lists multiple account-security changes that can restrict withdrawals for 24 hours.","bybit-withdrawal-faq","c4","Bitget says passkeys use asymmetric encryption and that the private key remains on the user device.","bitget-passkey","low","c5","Bitget says passkeys are domain-specific and only work on official Bitget domains.","c6","Bitget withdrawal guidance says Google Authenticator is required for withdrawals and that wrong wallet addresses can be irreversible.","bitget-withdraw"],"availableLocales":["en","zh-Hans"],"routeProjection":{"source":"nexualpha-news-route-projection-v1","locale":"zh-Hans","availableLocales":[]},"seo":{"noindex":true}},{"slug":"exchange-withdrawal-cooldown-disclosure-radar","status":"PUBLISHED","category":"research","categoryName":{"en":"Source-Backed Research","zh-Hans":"源头核验研究"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-04T08:58:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T08:58:00.000Z","readTime":"17 min","author":"NexuAlpha Research Desk","title":{"en":"Exchange Withdrawal Cooldown Disclosure Radar","zh-Hans":"交易所提现冷却期披露雷达"},"summary":{"en":"NexuAlpha's current radar scan finds that withdrawal cooldowns are not a single universal rule.","zh-Hans":"本文只处理可由当前官方或机构来源支撑的决策问题。它不预测价格，不承诺收益，不声称任何平台、API、钱包、稳定币轨道、托管路线、代币化资产或政策框架天然安全，也不把本地草稿、历史队列、旧截图、搜索摘要或 AI 摘要当成当前事实。"},"relatedVenues":[],"researchClaims":["c1","Bybit lists multiple account-security actions that can lead to 24-hour withdrawal restrictions.","b