n","name":"okx how to verify","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"OKX identity verification is listed as Identity document + face verification. The exact document set and limits must be checked on the official account screen.","citation":["https://www.okx.com/service-center"]}},{"@type":"Question","name":"okx app","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"OKX has a NexuAlpha app-download check with official iOS and Android store links. Use that page before installing or scanning any APK.","citation":["https://www.okx.com/service-center"]}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I check on OKX before choosing a trading route?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Start with OKX's published fee page, identity-verification support path, product scope, Web3 or DEX-style access, announcement taxonomy and proof-of-reserves source. NexuAlpha treats these as pre-signup checks, not as a promise that every account receives the same products, benefits or regional access.","citation":["https://www.okx.com/fees","https://www.okx.com/help/section/announcements-latest-announcements","https://www.okx.com/help/individual-identity-verification-eligibility-review-time-and-supported","https://www.okx.com/proof-of-reserves"]}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are OKX fees one blended exchange fee?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. OKX separates spot, futures, options and other instrument fee areas. Compare the product-specific fee page with the account level, region, order type and current official account flow.","citation":["https://www.okx.com/fees","https://www.okx.com/help/section/announcements-latest-announcements","https://www.okx.com/help/individual-identity-verification-eligibility-review-time-and-supported","https://www.okx.com/proof-of-reserves"]}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I verify after comparing OKX with Binance?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Open the OKX profile, the Binance vs OKX comparison and the factbook, then verify