pan><span>Whether fees, activities, listings, and product descriptions come from official pages</span></li><li><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="14" rx="3"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="11" r="2"></circle><path d="M6 16c0-3 6-3 6 0M15 10h3M15 14h3"></path></svg></span><span>Whether the intended route is CEX account access or Web3/wallet access</span></li></ul></article></div></section></section></div></div></div></section><section class="v3-profile-research-chapter" data-research-task="sources"><h3 class="v3-profile-sources-group__heading"><span class="vx-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 4-4 7-8 9-4-2-8-5-8-9V6Z"></path><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"></path></svg></span>Sources and security</h3><div class="v3-profile-research-chapter__body"><div class="v3-profile-evidence-block"><div class="v3-profile-evidence-block__body"><section class="v2-section v3-por-section" id="proof-of-reserves"><div class="v3-por-card"><div class="v3-por-header"><div class="v3-por-badge-row"><span class="v3-por-shield-badge"> <!-- -->Solvency &amp; PoR</span></div><h2 class="v3-por-title">OKX Proof of Reserves (PoR) &amp; On-Chain Solvency</h2><p class="v3-por-desc">OKX&#x27;s reserves, audit and solvency information should be checked against the latest official disclosure and a reproducible source; this page does not turn unverified figures into a guarantee.</p></div><div class="v3-por-verify-guide"><h4 class="v3-por-guide-title">3-Step Verification Guide</h4><div class="v3-por-steps"><div class="v3-por-step"><span class="v3-por-step-num">01</span><div><strong>Export Merkle Leaf Hash</strong><p>Log into your official account to export your unique cryptographic leaf node hash.</p></div></div><div class="v3-por-step"><span class="v3-por-step-num">02</span><div><strong>Run Open Source Verifier</strong><p>Verify along the Merkle Tree to confirm your asset balance is accurately counted.</p></div></div><div class="v3-por-step"><span class="v3-por-step-num">03</span><div><strong>Cross-Check On-Chain Wallets</strong><p>Verify that disclosed cold wallets hold total reserves exceeding cumulative liabilities.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="v3-por-footer"><div class="v3-por-cold-warning"><span class="v3-warning-icon"></span><div><strong>Non-Custodial Security Principle</strong><p>Proof of reserves reflects specific snapshot solvency. Transfer long-term substantial holdings to hardware cold wallets (Ledger/Trezor) to retain sovereign ownership.</p></div></div><span class="v3-por-audit-btn" style="cursor:text" data-source-plain="okx.com">View Official PoR Audit Report<span class="source-plain__domain"> · <!-- -->okx.com</span></span></div></div></section><section class="v2-section v3-security-section" id="anti-phishing"><div class="v3-security-card"><div class="v3-security-header"><div class="v3-security-badge-row"><span class="v3-security-tag"> <!-- -->Anti-Phishing &amp; Recorded Domains</span><span class="v3-verified-badge">NexuAlpha source record checked</span></div><h2 class="v3-security-title">OKX Recorded Domain Source Check &amp; Anti-Phishing Hub</h2><p class="v3-security-sub">Defend against Google Ads phishing clones and counterfeit social channels. Bookmark recorded primary domains and documented alternate domains below.</p></div><div class="v3-domains-grid"><div class="v3-domain-box primary"><div class="v3-domain-box__header"><span class="v3-domain-type">Primary Official Domain</span><span class="v3-ssl-indicator">● <!-- -->Source record match</span></div><div class="v3-domain-box__content"><code translate="no">www.okx.com</code><button type="button" class="v3-copy-domai